    "message": "Guidelines require LFTs and RFTs when TDF toxicity signs are present. Patient has trace proteinuria, low phosphate, and musculoskeletal symptoms consistent with TDF adverse events. No eGFR, urine protein quantification, or liver enzymes were ordered today. The plan defers review for 6 months without further renal investigation. Creatinine alone does not detect proximal tubular injury; eGFR and protein/creatinine ratio are needed.",
